	'messages:newarticle' => 'ses:(Itaaga)',
	'messages:newarticletext' => 'ses:War hanga dobu kaŋ ka fatta moo foo kaŋ ši bara jina ga.
Ka moɲoo tee, soobay ka hantum ganda bataa ra ([$1 faaba moɲoo] guna ka bay ka tonton.
Nda war n\' ka dere ka kaa ne, war ceecikaa <strong>banda</strong>butoŋoo naagu.',
	'messages:anontalkpagetext' => 'ses:----
<em>Faakaaray moɲoo woo goo goykaw kaŋ maaɲoo ši bangay se, boro kaɲ mana kontu tee jina, wal\'a ši a ka goy.</em>
Adiši kal\'ir ma goy nda hinna IP aderesu ka borey alhaaloo tabatandi.
IP aderesu dumoo woo ga hin ka žemnandi goykaw booboyaŋ game.
Nda war ti goykaw kaŋ maaɲoo ši bangay nda war ga tammahã kaŋ war ši kula nda šenney wey, [[Special:CreateAccount|kontu tee]] wala [[Special:UserLogin|huru]] ka ganji hiino war nda goykaw taney kaŋ šii nda maa ma birji cere ra. \\',
