	'messages:move-page-legend' => 'ses:Moɲoo ganandi',
	'messages:movepagetext' => 'ses:Ne ganda takaddaa goyyanoo ga moɲoo maaɲoo barmay, ka nga taarikoo kul ganandi maa taagaa here.
Maa žeenaa ka tee kuubiyan moo maa taagaa se.
War ga hin ka kuubiyaney taagandi k\'i sinji aššil maaɲoo ga ngi boŋše.
Nda war ši woo tee nd\'anniya, wa [[Special:DoubleRedirects|kuubiyan fillantey]] wala [[Special:BrokenRedirects|ikayrantey]] koroši boryo.
War allamaanaa woo kaŋ dobey ma gaabandi alhakiika ra ka sinja nungey kaŋ i ga hima ga koy ga.

Laasaabu kaŋ moɲoo <strong>ši</strong> ganandi nda moo foo ga bara maa taagaa cire ka ben, nda manti ikoraa ti kuubiyan nd\'a ši nda fasal taariki bisante,

<strong>Yaamar!</strong>
Woo ga hin ka ti barmay gaabante kaŋ boro ši a tammahãa moo maakoyni se;
 w\'alhakiika war ga faham misoo benantaa se jina nda war ga koy jine.',
	'messages:movepagetext-noredirectfixer' => 'ses:
